This distribution includes a modified veRL/EasyR1-style runtime from VPPO_RL.
Original Apache-2.0 license and source copyright notices are retained in LICENSE
and the vendored verl files. PACG training integration is in verl/trainer/pa_grpo.py
and verl/workers/actor/dp_actor.py; VPPO logic is retained in the actor and image
augmentation workers. This curated distribution removes private infrastructure
and SRPO experiments and supplies portable launchers and standalone diagnostics.
The shared backend retains compatibility utilities for other architectures and
disabled optimizer extensions; these are not separate experimental releases.

